# ── Shared environment variables ────────────────────────────────────────
# Loaded in ALL environments. Values here are the fallback/default and are
# OVERRIDDEN by .env.development (dev) and .env.production (prod).
#
# Keep environment-specific values (Clerk keys, API URLs) in those files,
# NOT here — anything set here also applies to production.
#
# Only EXPO_PUBLIC_* variables are exposed to the app bundle.
